# M6 (domain 5) multi-source claim scenarios. Each: id, type, claims=[[s,r,o,source],...].
#  agreed  - jointly consistent across sources (must NOT be flagged contested)
#  surface - a PAIR of sources directly conflicts (pairwise-detectable)
#  latent  - jointly inconsistent but NO two claims conflict (only deduction finds it)
# Entities are disjoint per scenario, so merging all scenarios into one source-set is clean.
